sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant MainAPI as Main FastAPI<br/>8081/TCP loopback
    participant HealthAPI as Health/Consumer FastAPI<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC/MariaDB)
    participant KServe as KServe Inference Logger
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh Agent
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant Scheduler as Background Scheduler

    Note over Client, MainAPI: Authenticated API Flow
    Client->>KRBP: HTTPS request<br/>Auth: Bearer/ServiceAccount
    KRBP->>KRBP: Authenticate via<br/>Kubernetes RBAC
    KRBP->>MainAPI: Forward to 127.0.0.1:8081<br/>(loopback, no encryption)
    MainAPI->>Storage: Read/write data
    Storage-->>MainAPI: Data response
    MainAPI-->>KRBP: JSON response
    KRBP-->>Client: Authenticated response

    Note over KServe, Storage: Inference Data Ingestion (KServe)
    KServe->>HealthAPI: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    HealthAPI->>HealthAPI: Parse CloudEvent<br/>Reconcile input/output by ID
    HealthAPI->>Storage: Persist inference data
    Storage-->>HealthAPI: Ack
    HealthAPI-->>KServe: 200 OK

    Note over ModelMesh, Storage: Inference Data Ingestion (ModelMesh)
    ModelMesh->>HealthAPI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    HealthAPI->>HealthAPI: Parse KServe v2 payload<br/>Reconcile input/output by ID
    HealthAPI->>Storage: Persist inference data
    Storage-->>HealthAPI: Ack
    HealthAPI-->>ModelMesh: 200 OK

    Note over Scheduler, Prom: Metrics Publishing
    loop Every 30s (configurable)
        Scheduler->>Storage: Read scheduled metric requests
        Storage-->>Scheduler: Metric data
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute fairness/drift metrics
        Scheduler->>HealthAPI: Update Prometheus counters/gauges
    end
    Prom->>HealthAPI: GET /q/metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    HealthAPI-->>Prom: Prometheus text format
